---
kind: lore
id: gifts
title: A lantern folded for someone
---

// (0.27) After school on day 8 the player gives someone a lantern folded in
// the wrapping minigame. The engine raises gift@npc.<person> with
// payload.hearts (0..5), which these beats read. Each arm writes its own
// suitor's run.aff member.

<beat id="treasured" on="gift" target="kind:suitor" title="A treasured lantern" when="occasion.payload.hearts >= 3 && run.route == occasion.target">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: {{occasion.target}} turns the lantern over in both hands. {{occasion.payload.hearts:plural(One heart|# hearts)}} in the fold, and every one of them showing.
  <match on="occasion.target">
    <when is="ren">
      ::set{run.aff.ren += 1}
      @ren{code="0010" emotion="flustered"}: This is... very straight folding. I'm keeping it. On the desk. Officially.
    </when>
    <when is="mika">
      ::set{run.aff.mika += 1}
      @mika{code="0010" emotion="fond"}: For me? I'm hanging it in my locker. No, over my bed. No — both. Fold me another.
    </when>
    <when is="soren">
      ::set{run.aff.soren += 1}
      @soren{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: I'll press it in the lantern book. Page two hundred. I've been saving page two hundred.
    </when>
    <when is="kai">
      ::set{run.aff.kai += 1}
      @kai{code="0010" emotion="fond"}: ...It's not bad. It's not bad at all. Don't look at me while I say that.
    </when>
  </match>
</beat>

<beat id="polite" on="gift" target="kind:suitor" title="A polite thank-you" priority="-5" once="false">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: {{occasion.target}} says thank you, and means it, and puts the lantern carefully in a pocket.
</beat>

<beat id="hotaru" on="gift" target="npc.hotaru" title="A lantern for the keeper">
  @hotaru{code="0010" emotion="fond"}: My own lantern. I've kept a hundred for other people. I'll keep this one for me.
</beat>

<beat id="nana" on="gift" target="npc.nana" title="A lantern for Nana" once="false">
  @nana{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: For the window? For ME? I'm putting it in the middle. Everyone else is getting demoted.
</beat>
